{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c2a3b4d5-2345-4b6c-9d7e-user000000002",
    "name": "TriloPlan User API",
    "description": "Backend API surface for the User app — seeded with everything already built for the USER role (auth, discovery, wallet, calls, chat, gifts, live viewing, moderation). No User-app Figma screens have been reviewed yet (only the Host app has been so far), so this collection is not screen-verified the way TriloPlan-Host is — it covers what the backend already exposes for USER, and should be revisited once the User app's screens are shared. See CLAUDE.md, BACKEND_PLAN.md and BRD.md in the repo for full backend context.\n\nCompanion collections: `TriloPlan-Host.postman_collection.json` (screen-verified against the Host app's Figma) and `TriloPlan-Admin.postman_collection.json`.\n\n## OTP login while there's no real SMS yet\nThe backend has a dev-only bypass (`OTP_BYPASS_VERIFICATION=true` in the server's `.env`, off in production): `POST /auth/otp/verify` accepts ANY phone + ANY 6-digit code, no prior `/otp/request` call required. This collection still calls `/otp/request` first and saves `devCode` (harmless either way).\n\n## Recommended run order (Collection Runner-safe, top to bottom)\nAuth — User Login → Profile (Me) → Setup — Counterpart Host → Hosts — Discovery & Follow → Wallet → Calls → Chat → Gifts → Live Broadcasting → Moderation → Auth — Session.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
  "event": [],
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userPhone", "value": "+919876520001", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userDevCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userAccessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userRefreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hostPhone", "value": "+919876520555", "type": "string", "description": "Counterpart HOST identity (Setup folder), so the user has someone real to browse/call/gift." },
    { "key": "hostDevCode", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hostAccessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "hostId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "callId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "kycUploadUrl", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "kycDocumentKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "chatConversationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "giftId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "liveBroadcastId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "reportId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth — User Login",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Request OTP — User Phone",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{userPhone}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "request"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.devCode) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userDevCode\", jsonData.devCode); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify OTP — User App",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{userPhone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{userDevCode}}\",\n  \"role\": \"user\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"] },
            "description": "Any 6-digit code works while OTP_BYPASS_VERIFICATION is on."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userAccessToken\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userRefreshToken\", jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", jsonData.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile (Me)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rahul\",\n  \"email\": \"rahul@mail.com\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1. Get KYC Upload URL",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"contentType\": \"application/pdf\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/kyc/upload-url", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "kyc", "upload-url"] },
            "description": "18+ age verification (BR-MOD-02) reuses the same KYC flow as hosts."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"kycUploadUrl\", jsonData.uploadUrl);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"kycDocumentKey\", jsonData.key);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Upload Document to S3",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/pdf", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "This is placeholder file content for testing the upload flow." },
            "url": { "raw": "{{kycUploadUrl}}", "host": ["{{kycUploadUrl}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Submit KYC Document",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"documents\": [\n    { \"documentType\": \"id_front\", \"key\": \"{{kycDocumentKey}}\" }\n  ]\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/kyc", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "kyc"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Get My KYC Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/kyc", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "kyc"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Setup — Counterpart Host",
      "description": "A throwaway HOST identity, online with a rate set, purely so the User flows below (browse, call, chat, gift) have someone real to act on.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Request OTP — Counterpart Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{hostPhone}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/request", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "request"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["var jsonData = pm.response.json();", "if (jsonData.devCode) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"hostDevCode\", jsonData.devCode); }"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify OTP — Counterpart Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{hostPhone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{hostDevCode}}\",\n  \"role\": \"host\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/otp/verify", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "otp", "verify"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"hostAccessToken\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"hostId\", jsonData.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Set Host Rate",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hostAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"ratePerMinutePaise\": 2400\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/host-profile", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "host-profile"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Set Host Online",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{hostAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"isOnline\": true\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/presence", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "presence"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hosts — Discovery & Follow",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Hosts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hosts?onlineOnly=true&sort=rating_desc&page=1&pageSize=20",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["hosts"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "onlineOnly", "value": "true" },
                { "key": "sort", "value": "rating_desc" },
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "20" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "sort also accepts rate_asc|rate_desc|online_first. Each host now includes rating: {average, count}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Follow Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{hostId}}/follow", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["hosts", "{{hostId}}", "follow"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List My Followed Hosts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/me/following", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["me", "following"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Unfollow Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hosts/{{hostId}}/unfollow", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["hosts", "{{hostId}}", "unfollow"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wallet",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Wallet",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallet", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wallet"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dev-Credit My Wallet (non-prod)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"amountPaise\": 500000\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/wallet/dev-credit", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["wallet", "dev-credit"] },
            "description": "No real payment gateway wired up yet — this is the \"Add money\" recharge stand-in."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Calls",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Initiate Call",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"hostId\": \"{{hostId}}\",\n  \"type\": \"video\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calls", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["calls"] },
            "description": "type is \"video\" or \"voice\" — the host needs the matching per-type rate set (Setup folder only sets the video rate)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"callId\", jsonData.callId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Get Call",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calls/{{callId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["calls", "{{callId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. End Call",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calls/{{callId}}/end", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["calls", "{{callId}}", "end"] },
            "description": "Ends a still-ringing call as \"missed\" if the host never accepted — fine for exercising the endpoint."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Submit Rating",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"stars\": 5\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/calls/{{callId}}/rating", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["calls", "{{callId}}", "rating"] },
            "description": "Only succeeds once the call has reached \"completed\" — will 409 if run right after End Call above left it \"missed\"."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Send Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"recipientId\": \"{{hostId}}\",\n  \"content\": \"Hey! Are you free for a quick call?\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/messages", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["chat", "messages"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"chatConversationId\", jsonData.conversationId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. List My Conversations",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["chat", "conversations"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Get Conversation Messages",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chat/conversations/{{chatConversationId}}/messages?page=1&pageSize=50",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["chat", "conversations", "{{chatConversationId}}", "messages"],
              "query": [{ "key": "page", "value": "1" }, { "key": "pageSize", "value": "50" }]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Gifts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. List Gift Catalog",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/gifts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["gifts"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "var rose = jsonData.gifts.find(function (g) { return g.name === \"Rose\"; });",
                  "if (rose) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"giftId\", rose.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Send Gift",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"recipientId\": \"{{hostId}}\",\n  \"giftId\": \"{{giftId}}\",\n  \"context\": \"chat\",\n  \"contextId\": \"{{chatConversationId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/gifts/send", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["gifts", "send"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Live Broadcasting",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Live Broadcasts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/live/broadcasts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["live", "broadcasts"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.broadcasts && jsonData.broadcasts.length > 0) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"liveBroadcastId\", jsonData.broadcasts[0].id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Join Broadcast",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/live/broadcasts/{{liveBroadcastId}}/join",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["live", "broadcasts", "{{liveBroadcastId}}", "join"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Send Live Chat Message",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"content\": \"You look great tonight!\"\n}" },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/live/broadcasts/{{liveBroadcastId}}/chat",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["live", "broadcasts", "{{liveBroadcastId}}", "chat"]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Leave Broadcast",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/live/broadcasts/{{liveBroadcastId}}/leave",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["live", "broadcasts", "{{liveBroadcastId}}", "leave"]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Moderation",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Block Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"userId\": \"{{hostId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/moderation/blocks", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["moderation", "blocks"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. List Blocked",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/moderation/blocks", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["moderation", "blocks"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Unblock Host",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/moderation/blocks/{{hostId}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["moderation", "blocks", "{{hostId}}"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. File Report",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"targetType\": \"host\",\n  \"targetId\": \"{{hostId}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Nudity or sexual content\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/moderation/reports", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["moderation", "reports"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["var jsonData = pm.response.json();", "if (jsonData.id) { pm.collectionVariables.set(\"reportId\", jsonData.id); }"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Log Capture Event",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"context\": \"call\",\n  \"contextId\": \"{{callId}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/moderation/capture-event", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["moderation", "capture-event"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth — Session",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Refresh Access Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{userRefreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/token/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "token", "refresh"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userAccessToken\", jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userRefreshToken\", jsonData.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{userAccessToken}}", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json", "type": "text" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{userRefreshToken}}\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "logout"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
